note [E++ 1.5a1: the first program. Text lives in double quotes.]
say "Hello, World!"
say "E++ looks like English, reads like English, and behaves like code."

note [Without quotes, E++ works the maths out:]
say 1 plus 1
say 2 times 3

note [With quotes it stays text, exactly as written:]
say "1 + 1"
